          "path": "_m/6/9/y/7/palermo-buenos-aires-wp/bar-el-taller.jpg",
          "filename": "Bar \"El Taller\" .jpg",
          "caption": "Located in front of Plaza Cortázar, the natural centre of the Palermo Viejo neighbourhood, this building tries to assume pre-existences and potentialities of the environment and its activities. Here we would like to verify that form follows context rather than function and that function is the event in permanent manifestation of past, present and future urban life. The bar was for years the headquarters of the Sociedad de Fomento de Palermo Viejo and accompanied us on a daily basis as an extension of our homes and studio. It has been extended by HRA in 1995, and sold and drastically remodelled by another professional studio in 2010. First Prize ‘Café construido’ CAYC Competition, VI Bienal de Arquitectura de Bs Aires 1995. Published in Summa nº242, October 1987 / Summa+ nº111",
